Now render-stage.js: stage-6 topology visibility + hop owners/lanes. render-stage.js is 239 lines; additions ~40 → ~280 OK.

renderStageTopology: add hasDns = stage >= 6; node-dns/node-router hidden toggles.

activeHopTarget: add stage 6 branch:
```js
if (snapshot.stage === 6) {
  const t = snapshot.trace ?? {};
  const hop = t.hop ?? 0;
  const backendCard = t.targetServer === '10.12' ? 'node-webserver-2' : 'node-webserver';
  const dbLane = t.dbOp === 'WRITE' ? 'packet-req-db' : 'packet-res-db';
  if (t.nx) {
    const owners = { 1: 'node-browser', 2: 'node-dns', 3: 'node-dns' };
    const lanes = { 1: 'packet-req-left', 2: 'packet-req-left', 3: 'packet-res-left' };
    return { cardId: owners[hop] ?? 'node-browser', laneId: lanes[hop] ?? 'packet-req-left' };
  }
  const shift = t.hosted ? 2 : 0;
  // chain hop = hop - shift (chain 1 = emit)
  const owners = {
    1: 'node-browser', 2: 'node-network', 3: 'node-lb', 4: 'node-db',
    5: backendCard, 6: 'node-network', 7: 'node-browser', 8: 'node-worker',
  };
  const lanes = {
    1: 'packet-req-left', 2: 'packet-req-right', 3: 'packet-req-lb',
    4: dbLane, 5: 'packet-res-cache', 6: 'packet-res-right', 7: 'packet-res-left', 8: 'packet-res-worker',
  };
  if (t.hosted) {
    owners[2] = 'node-dns'; lanes[2] = 'packet-req-left';
    owners[3] = 'node-dns'; lanes[3] = 'packet-res-left';
  }
  const chainHop = hop - shift;
  return { cardId: owners[chainHop] ?? 'node-browser', laneId: lanes[chainHop] ?? 'packet-req-left' };
}
```
Wait chain hop mapping for stage 5 non-async: 1 browser, 2 network, 3 lb, 4 db, 5 backend, 6 network, 7 browser, 8 worker ✓. For hosted: chainHop = hop-2; hop 2 → chain 0 (dns ask) → owners[0] undefined → fallback... I set owners[2]/owners[3] for dns — but those keys are chain-hop keys 2/3 (network/lb) — conflict! Instead: handle DNS hops before chain mapping:

```js
if (t.hosted && hop <= 3) {
  const owners = { 1: 'node-browser', 2: 'node-dns', 3: 'node-dns' };
  const lanes = { 1: 'packet-req-left', 2: 'packet-req-left', 3: 'packet-res-left' };
  return {...};
}
```
✓.

render-stage.js LANES dict: includes all needed ✓ (packet-req-left, packet-res-left, packet-req-right, packet-res-right, packet-req-lb, packet-res-lb, packet-req-cache, packet-res-cache, packet-req-db, packet-res-db, packet-req-queue, packet-res-queue, packet-req-worker, packet-res-worker) ✓ all used lanes exist.

